贡士也。十室之邑，必有忠信。若限年然后取士〖4〗，是吕尚、周晋不显于前世也〖5〗。其令郡国所选，勿拘老幼；儒通经术，吏达文法〖6〗，到，皆试用。有司纠故不以实者〖7〗。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
